From: =?UTF-8?q?Julian=20R=C3=BCth?= <julian.rueth@fsfe.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:44:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Do not install the LICENSE into the root of the PREFIX

the LICENSE gets already picked up https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/references/keywords.html#keyword-license-files

before this change you'd get this

```
$ python3 -m venv venv
$ venv/bin/pip install termscraper==0.10.0
$ find venv -name LICENSE
venv/LICENSE <-- this one shouldn't be here
venv/lib/python3.14/site-packages/termscraper-0.10.0.dist-info/LICENSE
[...]
```
---
 setup.py | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/setup.py b/setup.py
index a67babf..a9d4522 100644
--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -80,6 +80,5 @@ setup(
     keywords=["scraper", "pyte", "vt102", "vte", "terminal emulator"],
 
     packages=find_packages(),
-    data_files=[("", ["LICENSE"])]
 )
 
